From 58d8300a1e72163929ddb382e3b710b98e34fe0f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Michael Bestas <mkbestas@lineageos.org>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 15:38:42 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Merge tag 'LA.VENDOR.15.4.1.r1-11800-WAIPIO.QSSI16.0' into staging/lineage-24.0_merge-LA.VENDOR.15.4.1.r1-11800-WAIPIO.QSSI16.0

LA.VENDOR.15.4.1.r1-11800-WAIPIO.QSSI16.0

* tag 'LA.VENDOR.15.4.1.r1-11800-WAIPIO.QSSI16.0':
  hal: add NN NS model file into product package
  hal : Fix crash caused by race condition during stream access
  hal: fix for ringtone playback over A2DP is mute
  hal: Add support for hdmi out device
  hal: Decrease Deep buffer platform delay by 20 ms
  configs: Disable C2 audio compilation in target make files
  configs: add new flag to disable C2 compilation by default
  hal: configs: flag for dev prepare and graph start
  AHAL: ravelin: Add spatial audio head_tracker permission

Change-Id: Iedd493c98f1f867ba3d5963dd909280bbc06a513
---

diff --git a/configs/audio_vendor_product.mk b/configs/audio_vendor_product.mk
index 2e88516..04dc3ec 100644
